  "description": "# **The Faults of Exile**\n\n##### Accepting applications\n\n🔸No mandatory resource donations for Cursed and Banished players.\n\n🔸Farming alts welcome - feed challenges and stockpile so you can focus on leveling your main.\n\n🔸CL60 Raid Times (UTC): 6:00am + 7:00am.  Raid level will increase with guild and player level\n\n🔸This guild will be banished... eventually, right now we are focused on leveling and building the Guild Hall.  Planned additions: Teleport Beacon &amp; Energizing Pool.\n\n### **𝕸𝖆𝖞 𝕲𝖔𝖉 𝖍𝖆𝖛𝖊 𝖒𝖊𝖗𝖈𝖞 𝖔𝖓 𝖙𝖍𝖊 𝖍𝖊𝖝𝖊𝖉.**\n\n## **• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •**\n\n### 📜 **𝕲𝖚𝖎𝖑𝖉 𝕹𝖊𝖜𝖘** 📜\n\n🔸Top 50 Guilds of season 10 so far, we&#039;re punching above our weight class!\n\n🔸Armory weapons (combat buffs) ready to use, anyone donating to the stockpile and challenges will have access to these!\n\n###### Established April &#039;26 • • •\n###### discord.gg/wnEhRZFVfE",
